# Legacy singleton user-service provider environment (Codex/Claude/Qoder).
# The named v0.25.0 Linux Bridge unit does not load this file; use its private owner
# JSON policy and the provider's native authentication/configuration instead.
#
# Keep the legacy file minimal. Explicit proxy/advisor routing belongs to the
# private Bridge policy: for a singleton rendered from an env file, configure
# SERVERFS_PROXY_* and SERVERFS_AGENT_USE_PROXY / SERVERFS_JEV_USE_PROXY there.
# For a named owner configure proxy and each runtime/advisor use_proxy choice in
# its JSON policy. Provider-native settings can still affect egress; verify it.
#
# Install as:
#   ~/.config/serverfs-agent-bridge/provider.env
# owned by the current user, mode 0600.
#
# Examples:
# PATH=/home/<bridge-user>/.local/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://provider-native-endpoint.example
